  "stem": "已知方程\\(x ^ { 2 } -4x-1=0\\)的两根为\\(x_{ 1 } ,x_{ 2 }\\)，则\\(\\left ( { 1-x_{ 1 } } \\right )\\left ( { 1-x_{ 2 } } \\right )=\\)________．",
